  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for improving the green mobility service through ICT to respond to climate change in Kigali City, Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We aim to enhance the quality of life for citizens and contribute to achieving Rwanda Nationally Determined Contributions (NDC) for carbon reduction by improving public transportation services in Kigali City through the utilization of Information and Communication Technology (ICT). By leveraging these advanced technologies, we seek to increase accessibility to digital and green mobility options, specifically focusing on electric buses. This initiative not only supports the environmental objectives of reducing carbon emissions but also aligns with the broader vision of fostering sustainable urban development. Through these efforts, we intend to provide residents with more efficient, reliable, and environmentally friendly transportation solutions, thereby promoting a healthier urban environment and advancing Rwanda commitment to sustainable growth and ecological responsibility.1. &#xd0a4;&#xac08;&#xb9ac;&#xc2dc;&#xc758; &#xb3c4;&#xc2ec;&#xbaa8;&#xbe4c;&#xb9ac;&#xd2f0; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xac15;&#xd654;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xd6a8;&#xc728;&#xc131; &#xac15;&#xd654;
2. &#xd0a4;&#xac08;&#xb9ac;&#xc2dc;&#xc758; &#xb300;&#xc911;&#xad50;&#xd1b5; &#xd658;&#xacbd;&#xac1c;&#xc120;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc774;&#xc6a9;&#xb960; &#xc99d;&#xac00;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are committed to supporting the establishment of a comprehensive bus operation information management system and digital information provision facilities at public locations. This initiative includes plans to expand green mobility infrastructure and enhance bus terminal facilities. By implementing these measures, we aim to provide real-time, accessible information to commuters, thereby improving the efficiency and convenience of public transportation. The expansion of green mobility infrastructure, particularly for electric buses, will further promote sustainable transport solutions. Additionally, the upgrading of bus terminal facilities is intended to enhance passenger experience and accommodate the growing demand for public transit. These efforts collectively aim to create a more integrated, efficient, and environmentally friendly transportation network in Kigali City, ultimately contributing to the city&apos;s sustainable urban development and the well-being of its residents.</narrative>
  </description>
